## Installation

For command-line use with uv:

```bash
uv tool install [[ project_name ]]
```

Alternative with pipx:

```bash
pipx install [[ project_name ]]
```

Or with pip:

```bash
pip install [[ project_name ]]
```
[% else %]
## Setup

```bash
uv sync --group dev
```

Run the CLI:

```bash
uv run [[ project_name ]] --help
```
[% endif %]

## Development

Apply safe automatic fixes:

```bash
uv run nox -s fix
```

Run the complete quality suite:

```bash
uv run nox -s full
```

Run tests:

```bash
uv run nox -s tests
```

